# BuildKit reads this file instead of the root .dockerignore when building baselines/Dockerfile.
# The root file is an allowlist for the Julia campaign image and excludes baselines/ entirely,
# so the baseline image could not be built at all before this file existed (found 2026-09-23).
# Same allowlist style: only what the harness imports or reads. The trajectory export lives
# under outputs/ (gitignored) and is mounted at run time, never baked in.
*
!baselines/
!baselines/**
!analysis/
!analysis/**
!benchmarks/data/
!benchmarks/data/**
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
